  "details": "On joining some instances, the player is able to move around, but is unable to interact with buttons or perform emotes. Furthermore, everyone else sees the player stuck at spawn. Ouput logs show these two lines repeating over and over:\n\nError      -  Websocket closed! An error has occurred while connecting. : 1002\n\n\nError      -  Websocket exploded! An error has occurred in closing the connection. : WebSocketSharp.ErrorEventArgs\n\nI assume something has gone wrong server-side recently that is causing the client to mis-communicate with the server as this started happening only a few days ago.",
